#: ../../webgis-src/chb8_ref-addon/sec02_mapobj/section.rst:68
msgid ""
"QUERYMAP: The start tag of the QUERYMAP object, the QUERYMAP object "
"defines the display effect of the processing (MAP) query results, etc."
msgstr ""

